fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"d3d12/d3d12remap.html#d3d12remap:uv-remap","fragment":"\n\tuv-remap\n\nID3D12Resource for UV coordinates remapping. Valid formats are R8G8B8A8_UNORM and R16G16B16A16_UNORM. R -> U, G -> U, B -> unused, and A -> mask where A >= 0.5 applies remapping, otherwise fill background color\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n"});